Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Radical Piano
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (patch navigation templates below)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> character & microphone     (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> envelope & master          (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y-> (no Mod Wheel remotable; see below)
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerhead Software	se.propellerheads.radicalpiano
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	Character	Env
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"Radical Piano"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// Radical Piano has no drum pads; ready-to-enable templates:
// Map Pad 1		Select Previous Patch
// Map Pad 2		Select Next Patch
// Map Pad 3		Microphone 1 Type
// Map Pad 4		Microphone 2 Type

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): character & mics ---------
Map	Knob 1 A		Character
Map	Knob 2 A		Microphone 1 Type
Map	Knob 3 A		Microphone and Instrument Blend
Map	Knob 4 A		Microphone 2 Type

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): envelope & master --------
Map	Knob 1 B		Env Attack
Map	Knob 2 B		Env Decay Curve
Map	Knob 3 B		Env Release
Map	Knob 4 B		Master Volume

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
// Radical Piano responds to Pitch Bend and Sustain Pedal but exposes
// no Mod Wheel remotable. Use a Remote Override to re-point the Y axis
// to a continuous destination if desired:
//Map	Joystick Y		Character